  "title": "MizarVision publishes AI-processed satellite imagery of US military assets",
  "url": "https://defence-industry.eu/mizarvision-publishes-ai-processed-satellite-imagery-of-u-s-military-assets-raising-intelligence-and-security-concerns/",
  "snippet": "Shanghai-based AI startup MizarVision is publishing near-real-time annotated satellite imagery of US military assets globally. The company uses Vantor (formerly Maxar) 0.3m resolution commercial satellite data processed with AI object detection to identify and classify military hardware, bases, and deployments. Reports indicate Iran's IRGC has been using MizarVision data for strike planning during the ongoing conflict. Raises major OSINT security concerns about commercial satellite intelligence proliferation.",
